IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0038.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 CUST-AGE           PIC 9(3).
    05 LEDGER-BAL         PIC 9(9)V99.
    05 ACCOUNT-TYPE       PIC X.
    05 STD-RATE           PIC 9V9999.
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 FINAL-RATE         PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM SENIOR-BONUS
    DISPLAY "FINAL-RATE=" FINAL-RATE
    STOP RUN.
SENIOR-BONUS.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2001
    *>  IF CUST-AGE >= 48
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF CUST-AGE >= 60 AND LEDGER-BAL >= 10000
        COMPUTE FINAL-RATE = STD-RATE + 0.0025
    ELSE
        MOVE STD-RATE TO FINAL-RATE
    END-IF.
